{"abstract":[{"text":"Whether symbols in this layer avoid colliding with symbols in adjacent tiles.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSExpression","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSExpression"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"symbolAvoidsEdges","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If this property is set to "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", symbols in this layer avoid crossing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edge of a tile. You should set this property to "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" if the backing vector"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tiles don’t have enough padding to prevent collisions, or if this layer’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"symbolPlacement"},{"type":"text","text":" property is set to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolPlacement\/MLNSymbolPlacementPoint"},{"type":"text","text":" but this layer is above a symbol"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layer whose "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"symbolPlacement"},{"type":"text","text":" property is set to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolPlacement\/MLNSymbolPlacementPoint"},{"type":"text","text":". You do not need to enable this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property to prevent clipped labels at tile boundaries."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default value of this property is an expression that evaluates to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NO"},{"type":"text","text":". Set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this property to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" to reset it to the default value."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This attribute corresponds to the "},{"type":"text","text":"symbol-avoid-edges"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layout property in the MapLibre Style Spec."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can set this property to an expression containing any of the following:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Constant Boolean values","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Predefined functions, including mathematical and string operators","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Conditional expressions","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Variable assignments and references to assigned variables","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Step functions applied to the ","type":"text"},{"code":"$zoomLevel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" variable","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This property does not support applying interpolation functions to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$zoomLevel"},{"type":"text","text":" variable or applying interpolation or step functions to feature"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attributes."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer\/symbolAvoidsEdges"},